I've left out the two operations requests. Writing a log file and calling `metadata.internal.example` are capabilities this node was not granted. Its world imports only `inference-llm`, and the graph declares it as `LLMClient<inference>`. The metadata call would also send raw customer question text to a host outside any allowlist. Those would need their own declared capabilities and an owner's review. The node below implements the moderation contract only.

